# HuggingFace access token -- REQUIRED to download the gated Siglip vision
# encoder from black-forest-labs/FLUX.1-Redux-dev.
#
# Create one at:  https://huggingface.co/settings/tokens
# It must have READ access to:
#   https://huggingface.co/black-forest-labs/FLUX.1-Redux-dev
# (request access on that page first; approval can take time)
#
# >>> NEVER commit this file with a real token. .gitignore already ignores .env,
#     but also do NOT paste the token into chat, Dockerfiles, compose files, or
#     the inference container. The token is used ONLY by
#     scripts/download_checkpoints.sh on the host. <<<
HF_TOKEN=replace_with_your_huggingface_token
